{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06738","headline":"赠史昭 · 王昌龄","name":"赠史昭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东林月未升，廓落星与汉。\n是夕鸿始来，斋中起长叹。\n怀哉望南浦，眇然夜将半。\n但有秋水声，愁使心神乱。\n握中何爲赠，瑶草已衰散。\n海鳞未化时，各在天一岸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}